            "review_title": "Review at Okami Spicy Kitchen-woodfired",
            "review_text": "Nancy\n11 contributions\n0\nDiscover Okami Seafood Steaks Woodfired\nDec 2024 • Family\nIf you're looking for a place that feels like home while serving up incredible food, Okami Seafood Steaks Woodfired is a must-visit. This modern bistro combines the charm of woodfired cooking with a cozy, welcoming atmosphere that’s perfect for any occasion.\n\nThe star of the show here is the woodfired menu. Every dish is packed with smoky flavors that only a woodfired grill can deliver. The French chef behind the kitchen ensures every bite is authentic, delicious, and unforgettable.\n\nThe space itself is warm and inviting, with a modern design that still feels comfortable and relaxed. Whether you're celebrating a special moment or just grabbing dinner with friends, it’s the perfect spot to unwind. The staff are super friendly, making you feel like a regular even on your first visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 4, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
